      "provenance" = "Pinned from The Dragon Vol. 1 No. 3 (October 1976): folios 26-27, Larry Smith's A New View of Dwarves - the nine-level Fighting Man ladder with the dice-plus forms split to base and bonus, the kingship of the seven families with Durin on the 7-8 of a d8, the Greyhawk cleric and thief options with their swapped dice, the fourteen abilities, the reaction modifiers with the Goblins-and-Orcs auto attack, and the folk wisdom; folios 14-16, Brad Stock and Brian Lane's Birth Tables for D&D - the ten-table character generation system from social class through sibling rank, social rank wealth, the three skills groups, the nobility rolls with the royalty rules, the adventurer fathers, the race rolls with the dice grid and requirement bands, and the previous-experience multipliers; folios 20-21, Lewis Pulsipher's letter - the Silvan, Sindar and Eldar-proper system with the True Sight powers and the over-sea doctrine, as deltas against the R888 Smith Eldar pin. The editors ran the Smith rebuttal beside the letter; both systems stand, the deltas noted, never silent.",
